{"id":"ics-041","stemHtml":"<p>有下面的 C 代码，<code>int</code> 占 4 字节，数组按行优先存放，<code>a</code> 的首地址为 <code>0x1000</code>：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">int a[3][4];</code></pre></p>\n<p>回答：</p>\n<p>（1）<code>sizeof(a)</code> 与 <code>sizeof(a[1])</code> 分别是多少？</p>\n<p>（2）<code>&amp;a[2][3]</code> 的地址是多少？</p>\n<p>（3）<code>a[1] + 2</code> 的地址是多少？它指向哪个元素？</p>\n<p>（4）<code>a[1]</code> 与 <code>a</code> 的类型分别是什么？为什么 <code>a + 1</code> 与 <code>a[1] + 1</code> 前进的字节数不同？</p>\n<p>（5）若 <code>int *p = &amp;a[0][0];</code>，那么 <code>p + 6</code> 指向哪个元素？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>二维数组 <code>int a[3][4]</code> 的元素是「4 个 int 组成的一维数组」。地址偏移公式是「行下标 × 列数 + 列下标」再乘以元素大小。指针加法按「所指类型的大小」缩放：<code>a</code> 指向一行（16 字节），<code>a[1]</code> 指向一个 int（4 字节）。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p>二维数组的地址计算只需抓住两件事：行优先存储（整行存完再存下一行）和「指针加 1 前进多少由所指类型决定」。把 <code>a</code> 看成一个「元素是 <code>int[4]</code> 的数组」，<code>a[i]</code> 就是第 <code>i</code> 个 <code>int[4]</code>，它退化为指向首元素的 <code>int *</code>；这样 <code>a+1</code> 跳过一整行 16 字节，而 <code>a[1]+1</code> 只跳过一个 int 4 字节，就都顺理成章了。</p>\n<p>（1）<code>a</code> 是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 的 <code>int</code> 数组：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{sizeof}(a)=3\\times4\\times4=48,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{sizeof}(a[1])=4\\times4=16.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>（2）行优先下，<code>a[2][3]</code> 前面有\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times4+3=11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n个 <code>int</code>，所以偏移为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\times4=44</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span></span></span></span> 字节：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&amp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x1000</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x102C</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\&amp;a[2][3]=\\texttt{0x1000}+44=\\texttt{0x102C}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">&amp;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x1000</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x102C</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>（3）<code>a[1]</code> 指向第 1 行首元素，即 <code>&amp;a[1][0]</code>。它的偏移是\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1\\times4+0)\\times4=16,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n所以\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x1000</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x1018</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a[1]+2=\\texttt{0x1000}+16+2\\times4=\\texttt{0x1018},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x1000</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8055em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x1018</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n指向 <code>a[1][2]</code>。</p>\n<p>（4）<code>a[1]</code> 的类型是 <code>int *</code>（指向一行的首元素）；<code>a</code> 的类型是 <code>int (*)[4]</code>（指向「含 4 个 int 的数组」）。因此：</p>\n<ul>\n<li<code>a + 1</code> 前进一整行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times4=16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节，指向第二行；</li>\n<li<code>a[1] + 1</code> 前进一个 <code>int</code> 4 字节，指向 <code>a[1][1]</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>（5）<code>p</code> 是 <code>int *</code>，<code>p + 6</code> 前进 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\times4=24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span> 字节。把一维下标 6 按行优先还原：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6=1\\times4+2,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n即第 1 行第 2 列，所以 <code>p + 6</code> 指向 <code>a[1][2]</code>（与（3）的地址相同）。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是把 <code>&amp;a[2][3]</code> 的偏移算成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times3\\times4=24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span>（把列数 4 写成 3，或把行、列下标相乘）。二是认为 <code>a + 1</code> 只前进 4 字节——<code>a</code> 的元素是整行，不是单个 <code>int</code>。三是把 <code>a[1]+2</code> 的地址算成 <code>0x1000+16+2=0x1012</code>，忘记乘 <code>sizeof(int)</code>。四是把 <code>p+6</code> 的行列还原算错（6 对应第 1 行第 2 列，不是第 6 个元素所在行的第 0 列）。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>（1）<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span>；（2）<code>0x102C</code>；（3）<code>0x1018</code>，指向 <code>a[1][2]</code>；（4）<code>a[1]</code> 是 <code>int *</code>，<code>a</code> 是 <code>int (*)[4]</code>，<code>a+1</code> 前进 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节、<code>a[1]+1</code> 前进 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 字节；（5）<code>a[1][2]</code>\n"}